The temperature is falling fast, on land and at sea.
It may be the Snow Lady. During the War of the Worlds against Yagditha, Leusen had found her in her ice prison. Yagditha freed her and used her to build a device to freeze the surface. But his plan failed and he abandoned her. After being defeated, the Snow Lady disappeared.
I was told that a river of glacial lava appeared in Gallubia Valley and another at the bottom of the sea, turning every creature it touches into an ice monster.

We have to stop this. We need Ruby's help.

[Challenge Objective]

Talk to Ruby, the Fire Priestess, in Pillai.
